              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arik’ uku az’ abe ari ko mubagirira: muze musangangure ibicaniro vyabo, mumenagure amabuye bashinze, mutemagure inkingi bashingiye Ashera, muturire ibishushanyo vyabo bibājwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.5"
            ]
          }
