              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Icatumye Uhoraho abakunda, akabatoranya, s’uko mwarusha ayandi mahanga yose ubginshi; mbere mwar’ ubusa hanyuma y’ayandi yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
