        {
          "text": "Ariko n’uk’ Uhoraho abakunda, akagomba gushitsa indahiro yarahiye ba sogokuruza banyu; ni co catumye Uhoraho abakūzay’ ububasha bgiwe bginshi, akabagobōtora, akabakūra mu nzu y’ubuja, no mu maboko ya Farawo umwami wa Egiputa. ",
