        {
          "text": "Nuko rero mumenye yuk’ Uhoraho Imana yanyu ari yo Mana; n’Imana yo kwizigirwa, yama ishitsa isezerano, ikagirira imbabazi abayikunda, bakitondera ivyagezwe vyayo, ikageza ku runganwe rwabo uko ruzogenda rukurikirana gushitsa igihumbi; ",
