        },
        {
          "text": "ibigerageza bikomeye amaso yanyu yiboneye, n’ ibimenyetso n’ibitangaza, n’ingen’ Uhoraho Imana yanyu yabakūjey’ ukuboko kw’inkomezi kandi kubanguye; uko ni kw azogirira amahanga yose muzoba mufitiye ubgoba. ",
          "type": "text",
